# Frontend style

- Components: one job. Pages orchestrate; shared UI under `frontend/src/components/`.
- Effects: clean up subscriptions (`EventSource`, timers). Treat StrictMode double-mount as expected.
- API access only through `frontend/src/api.ts`.
- User-visible copy: plain sentences, no em dashes.
- Prefer CSS variables already in `styles.css`; match existing visual language.
- After SPA changes: `cd frontend && npm run build` so `frontend/dist` stays in sync with uvicorn.
